      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Results are reported of a study of the lipid peroxidation (LP) in 33 patients with ischemic heart disease (IHD), hypertensive disease (HD) and their associations during anaprilin treatment. During deterioration of the course of HD and IHD there occurs initiation of LP of membranes most pronounced in association of these diseases. Anaprilin reduces the activity of LP products."},
